00:00:54.328 --> 00:00:55.595
CHARGING THE PRESIDENT WITH A

00:00:55.596 --> 00:00:57.296
CRIME WAS THEREFORE NOT AN

00:00:57.297 --> 00:00:58.731
OPTION WE COULD CONSIDER.

