00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:40.833
NOTHING SHOULD BE RULED OUT.

00:02:40.834 --> 00:02:43.870
&gt;&gt; NOTHING IS OFF THE TABLE.

00:02:43.871 --> 00:02:45.671
WE ARE LEGISLATING, WE ARE

00:02:45.672 --> 00:02:46.772
